[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-installation-instructions-1600x120.png[/img]

[size=3][b][u]Via Vortex/MO2[/u][/b][/size]
Install as normally would any mod. 
[size=3][b][u]Manually[/u][/b][/size]
Really please use a mod manager :) Download the current zip file. Please everything in the Data folder in the zip to the same place under <Game Install Dir aka where starfield.exe is>\Data.  

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-my-other-creations-1600x120.png[/img]
[b][u]Modding Tools[/u][/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/1999]Creations Forge[/url]: A cross-platform desktop and command-line application for importing, browsing, and comparing Bethesda plugin records for Fallout 4, Skyrim, and Starfield.[/*]
[/list]
[size=3][b][u]Starfield[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/7097]Venworks - Core Utilities[/url]: A utility library all my creations share[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/17685]Venworks - Dynamic Scenes Engine[/url]: A framework creating dynamic and replayable content in Creation Kit[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/8050]Venworks - Encounters Overhaul[/url]: Fixes the open world caves and encounters that do not spawn enemies unless you are on a rare random encounter quest so are completely empty most of the time[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/17104]Venworks Customizable HUD and Themes[/url]: Provides multiple faction themes for HONKCORE[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/8411]Fix for Walter Vanishing in MQ101 and blocking quests[/url]: If certain level lists are overridden Walter stops functioning and vanishes, this stops that[/*]
[/list]

